            {
              "id": "b000010",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>The Faculty of Business Studies and Finance (FBSF) is one of the academic faculties of Wayamba University of Sri Lanka, offering undergraduate, postgraduate, diploma and external programmes across accountancy, banking and finance, business management, and insurance and valuation. The faculty is committed to excellence in teaching, research and industry engagement.</p>",
                "alignment": "left",
                "text_color": "#2b2f36",
                "_text_color": "#2b2f36",
                "_font_size": {
                  "unit": "px",
                  "size": 15
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b000011",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>Established in 1999, the faculty continues to build tomorrow’s business and finance leaders through quality education and research that connects academia with industry.</p>",
                "alignment": "left",
                "text_color": "#2b2f36",
                "_text_color": "#2b2f36",
                "_font_size": {
                  "unit": "px",
                  "size": 15
                }
              }
            },
